    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Максим молодец.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maxim did great.' Kostya praises Max's performance. He tells Nastya that Maxim did a great job.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Он помог Вике.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He helped Vika.' He highlights Max's good deed. Kostya points out that Max helped Vika.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Он спас вечер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He saved the evening.' Kostya summarizes the impact of Max's actions. He says Max saved the entire evening.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Да, она наговорила гадости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, she said awful things.' Nastya recalls Vika's earlier behavior. She notes that Vika said some awful things.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Ему всякие гадости.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All sorts of awful things to him.' She emphasizes how mean Vika was. Nastya mentions Vika said all sorts of nasty things to him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "И ей очень стыдно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And she feels terrible.' Nastya knows how Vika is feeling now. She says Vika feels terrible and ashamed.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "И как же она это исправит?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So how's she going to make it right?' Kostya wonders about the next steps. He asks how Vika plans to fix the situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Что она будет делать?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What will she do?' He is curious about Vika's strategy. Kostya asks what she is going to do.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "А, водка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ah, vodka.' Nastya spots the solution immediately. She simply points out the vodka.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Она нальёт ему водки.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She will pour him vodka.' She explains Vika's apology method. Nastya predicts Vika will pour him a drink.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Это хороший план.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's a good plan.' Kostya approves of the strategy. He agrees that it is a very good plan.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "nastya",
      "t": "Она знает, что делать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She knows what to do.' Nastya is confident in Vika's abilities. She notes that Vika always knows exactly what to do. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
